  "comments": "The work is discussed in [FZ6N88AU], and [MGPRHX73] discusses its authorship, identifying the author as 'Jad pa gzhon nu byang chub (ID:3863), a student of 'Jad pa byang chub skyabs (ID:3864), himself a student of Phya pa (ID:3831).\r\nThis epistemological summary is one of the best sources for the identification of the Tibetan interpreters referred to in epistemological works, as it names them explicitly (see [FZ6N88AU]: 415-416 for references).",
